exports[`the Communication pack adds its rules and links the neutral voice and the sharing skills 1`] = `
"# Communication

- Before you draft anything I send or publish, such as a chat message, an email, a pull request description, or a doc, read the \`writing-voice\` skill and write in that voice.
- When I ask for an update, lead with the outcome, then what is left and what waits on me.
- To share a plan, report, or page with other people, publish it with the \`share-plan\` skill and give me the link. Say that anyone with the link can read it.
"
`;
